      "Rounds that crack past this NPC pin it down: worse aim, slower to shoot back, bursts held while pinned, and a push into cover.",
      [
        "ALifeCreatorCore.lua:350"
      ]
    ],
    "115": [
      "IGUI_ALifeUI_120e5f9766971e7f",
      "Any rifle in the squad can lay steady covering fire while a squadmate moves to cover or flanks.",
      [
        "ALifeCreatorCore.lua:351"
      ]
    ],
    "116": [
      "IGUI_ALifeUI_0589b2ad7a6150b0",
      "When the enemy reloads or goes down, the squad re-aims and advances together in a line, shooting.",
      [
        "ALifeCreatorCore.lua:352"
      ]
    ],
    "117": [
      "IGUI_ALifeUI_7eea27be4a0b7641",
      "The squad prefers the target a squadmate just called, so fire lands on one enemy instead of spreading.",
      [
        "ALifeCreatorCore.lua:353"
      ]
    ],
    "118": [
      "IGUI_ALifeUI_0c2b6b833ec8c829",
